        "original_id": "d380730d-ebcf-5fb3-b3f2-852262d3c8c9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Knicks–Nuggets brawl, Pacers–Pistons brawl\n- Organizations: National Basketball Association, Associated Press\n- Teams: New York Knicks, Denver Nuggets, Indiana Pacers, Detroit Pistons\n- Places: Madison Square Garden, New York City, The Palace of Auburn Hills, Auburn Hills, Michigan\n\nFacts:\n- The Pacers–Pistons brawl was an altercation during an NBA game between the Indiana Pacers and Detroit Pistons on November 19, 2004, at The Palace of Auburn Hills in Auburn Hills, Michigan.\n- The Associated Press called the Pacers–Pistons brawl the most infamous brawl in NBA history.\n- The Knicks–Nuggets brawl was an on-court altercation during an NBA game between the New York Knicks and Denver Nuggets on December 16, 2006, at Madison Square Garden in New York City.\n- The Knicks–Nuggets brawl was the most penalized on-court fight in the NBA since the Pacers–Pistons brawl two years earlier.",
